OL,5,G0232FAssignment
OL,6,     GIceland is one of the few nations
OL,7,     Gwithout a national military. Its
OL,8,     Gsecurity relies on international
OL,9,     Galliances and a civilian defence
OL,10,     Gforce. Is this a sustainable
OL,11,     Gstrategy?
